  <builtin-type> ::= u <source-name> [<template-args>] # vendor extended type


7/26/23  [EDGcpfe/26525]
Remove predefined macro definition for _M_X64 and _M_AMD64

Previously, make_win_predef_macro defined _M_AMD64 and _M_X64.  This
functionality has been removed, and the front end is now responsible for
