6/5/23   [EDGcpfe/26345]
Added %u error message fill-in

mk_errinfo has been updated to support the %u fill-in (with the -mml
command-line option).


3/16/23  [EDGcpfe/26146]
Fixed issues with dettarg calculations, primarily affecting 32-bit systems

Previously ik_int was not handled by the improvements introduced by
EDGcpfe/25681 in version 6.4 (see entry of 10/14/22).  This resulted in dettarg
being unable to calculate the jmp_buf buffer size if it was determined (for
alignment purposes) that the jmp_buf buffer should be composed of integers.
This is now fixed.

Additionally, a pre-existing issue where alignment was not calculated correctly
for the jmp_buf type has been fixed.


