5/17/13  [EDGcpfe/7689,EDGcpfe/13901]
C++11: Delegating constructors

Add demangling for the EDG-specific delegation constructors ("C9") and
destructors ("D9").


5/9/13   [EDGcpfe/14012]
Demangling of an expression in a variable-sized array

A change has been made to demangle an expression that appears as an
array bound in a variable-sized array type in the Cfront ABI (the IA-64 ABI
demangling had previously allowed this).


4/23/13  [EDGcpfe/8627]
C++11: demangling ref-qualifiers on member functions

A change has been made to demangle ref-qualifiers that may be found on member
function types.  The IA-64 ABI mangling scheme is followed for IA-64 ABI
configurations.  For Cfront configurations, an optional "_R" (for an lvalue
ref-qualifier) or "_E" (for an rvalue ref-qualifier) may follow the "F"
encoding for a function type, and is demangled appropriately.


