Version 3.10, September 23, 2007

6/1/07   Add casts to allow decode.c to be compiled by a C++ compiler

Casts of values returned by malloc/realloc were missing, causing
compilation errors when using a C++ compiler (rather than the more
typical C compiler).  This is now fixed.

